      "ownerPath": "crates/liskov-control-plane-api/src/application_custody_signer.rs",
      "ownerCommit": "4526233012b28c33a849e8f1cb1ddac220ccf179",
      "fact": "When a customer-funded root exists, executedFunding.available is true and the body includes source, unit, admitted, openReserves, settled, settledPlanck, unresolvedHolds and oldestUnresolvedHoldAgeMs. The only unavailable reason is no_customer_funded_execution.",
